@prefix c: <https://curricula.live/id/formal-sciences/concept/> .
@prefix v: <https://curricula.live/id/formal-sciences/vocab/> .
@prefix scheme: <https://curricula.live/id/formal-sciences/scheme/> .
@prefix skos: <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#> .

c:dpll-algorithm v:uses c:unit-propagation .
c:conflict-driven-clause-learning v:uses c:unit-propagation .
c:dpll-algorithm v:solves c:boolean-satisfiability .
c:conflict-driven-clause-learning v:solves c:boolean-satisfiability .
c:hoare-logic skos:related c:program-correctness .
c:hoare-logic skos:related c:axiomatic-semantics .
c:resolution-refutation v:uses c:resolution-logic .
c:conflict-driven-clause-learning v:uses c:clause-learning .
c:clause-learning skos:related c:resolution-logic .
c:symbolic-model-checking skos:broader c:model-checking .
c:weakest-precondition skos:related c:hoare-logic .
